# Skills kept in the global Claude skills directory. One name per line;
# # starts a comment.
#
# install.sh moves anything here that is not listed to skills-archive/ beside
# it. Moved, never deleted: several skills have no upstream recorded anywhere
# on disk, so a delete would be irreversible.
#
# This file only governs skills installed from this repo. Plugin skills cannot
# be removed individually -- `claude plugin disable` takes a plugin, not a
# skill, and edits to the plugin cache are wiped on update. superpowers is
# all-or-nothing and is kept.
#
# caveman used to be one of those plugins. It is now vendored here as a skill,
# because the plugin was removed from this machine and took the response style
# documented in CLAUDE.md with it. See NOTICE for the upstream revision.

caveman
karpathy-guidelines
